# predict_gender
**Type:** tool
**Module:** packages.haive-tools.src.haive.tools.tools.genderize_tool
**Class:** StructuredTool

## Description
Predict gender from a single first name, with optional country scope.

## Schema
```json
{
  "description": "Predict gender from a first name using the Genderize.io API.\n\nArgs:\n    name: The first name to predict gender for\n    country_id: Optional two-letter country code (ISO 3166-1 alpha-2)\n        to scope the search to a specific country\n\nReturns:\n    GenderizeResponse: An object containing the predicted gender, probability,\n        and other metadata from the API\n\nRaises:\n    requests.exceptions.HTTPError: If the API request fails",
  "properties": {
    "name": {
      "title": "Name",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "country_id": {
      "anyOf": [
        {
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "type": "null"
        }
      ],
      "default": null,
      "title": "Country Id"
    }
  },
  "required": [
    "name"
  ],
  "title": "predict_gender",
  "type": "object"
}
```

## Usage as Tool
**Tool Name:** `predict_gender`
**Description:** Predict gender from a single first name, with optional country scope.

